            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740340/extras/198b9347b8cabc297b56715028b6767f.avif?t=1790388770\" width=250 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find yourself inside an underground megastructure controlled by an AI. Dive into NEUROMATRIX, an immersive, first-person &quot;escape room&quot; style adventure. Features include a minimalist aesthetic, liminal spaces, atmospheric exploration, sci-fi elements, action (shooting), and puzzles. 17 levels, with more to come! ...And yes, there is a way out to the surface!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s just me, pouring my soul into this vision, crafting one level at a time. Want to back an indie dev’s grind? Grab NEUROMATRIX and take on the challenge! Your support keeps this dream alive, thanks for stepping into my world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740340/extras/198b9347b8cabc297b56715028b6767f.avif?t=1790388770\" width=250 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find yourself inside an underground megastructure controlled by an AI. Dive into NEUROMATRIX, an immersive, first-person &quot;escape room&quot; style adventure. Features include a minimalist aesthetic, liminal spaces, atmospheric exploration, sci-fi elements, action (shooting), and puzzles. 17 levels, with more to come! ...And yes, there is a way out to the surface!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s just me, pouring my soul into this vision, crafting one level at a time. Want to back an indie dev’s grind? Grab NEUROMATRIX and take on the challenge! Your support keeps this dream alive, thanks for stepping into my world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "Dive into NeuroMatrix, a gripping first-person escape room adventure within the twisted, ever-evolving mind of an A.I.",
